<http://data.silknow.org/object/424a0e9d-d813-3662-83ff-8315d2566dac>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "1700s, Persian; Flowers"@en , "Woven silk and metal thread\nDisplayed behind glass.\nUndyed silk main warp; pink silk binding warp.\nWefts: blue, yellow, green and brown silk and silver-gilt strip S-wound on a yellow silk core.\nGold ground with a repetition of one motif in an ogival grouping with pairs of serrated leaves at the base below a white vase edged with green and containing an abundance of white and blue flowers. Between these are 4 curved serrated leaves which form an X shape with a blue and white flower where they meet.  Above and below the X is a small flower and pair of leaves.  Filling the spaces is a vertical blue S- or Z-bar with a white rosette in the middle of a green and blue flower.  These small floral sprigs create a zigzag band of motifs between the bands of ogees."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/c10c9091-0b9e-3695-ba05-58d25eae6f96> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "1700s, Persian; Flowers"@en , "Woven silk and metal thread\nDisplayed behind glass.\nUndyed silk main warp; pink silk binding warp.\nWefts: blue, yellow, green and brown silk and silver-gilt strip S-wound on a yellow silk core.\nGold ground with a repetition of one motif in an ogival grouping with pairs of serrated leaves at the base below a white vase edged with green and containing an abundance of white and blue flowers. Between these are 4 curved serrated leaves which form an X shape with a blue and white flower where they meet.  Above and below the X is a small flower and pair of leaves.  Filling the spaces is a vertical blue S- or Z-bar with a white rosette in the middle of a green and blue flower.  These small floral sprigs create a zigzag band of motifs between the bands of ogees."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/424a0e9d-d813-3662-83ff-8315d2566dac/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/424a0e9d-d813-3662-83ff-8315d2566dac/dimension/2> ;
